   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "HaDeS MOSS Suite - Img2Img (the tenth video tutorial)\n\n1. Load your image and encode it with VAE Encode (no MOSS Latent needed: size comes from the image).\n2. In FLOW models at few steps (here 8 steps with Turbo v1.0), ComfyUI's stock denoise mode\n   (steps / denoise (core)) rounds int(8 / 0.9) = 8 -> start_sigma 1.000 (pure noise, ignores input).\n3. Set MOSS KSampler's denoise_mode to exact: denoise 0.9 starts at start_sigma 0.978, keeping the\n   input composition while reimagining the lighting and style (~3.2 s on RTX 5090).\n4. Up to denoise 0.5 both modes are identical (start_sigma 0.833). Suite Telemetry shows start_sigma.\nMeasurements: tools/RESULTS.md."
   ],
   "properties": {}
